<%- include('../partials/head') %><%- include('../partials/topbar') %>
<main class="content settings-page"><div class="settings-head"><div><span class="settings-kicker">DATA DELETION</span><h1>Akkauntni o‘chirish</h1><p class="muted">Google Play account deletion talabi uchun ochiq web-resurs.</p></div><a class="btn ghost" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></div>
<section class="card settings-card"><h2>Nimalar o‘chiriladi?</h2><p>Akkaunt profili, login sessiyalari, post/storylar, kommentlar, like/save/feed signallari, chat suhbatlari va xabarlari, push subscriptionlar, report/relation yozuvlari hamda Lumi boshqaruvidagi tegishli Cloudflare R2 media fayllari live tizimdan o‘chiriladi.</p><p class="muted">Hosting/storage provayderining backup nusxalari mavjud bo‘lsa, ular normal backup-rotation muddati tugaguncha vaqtincha qolishi mumkin.</p></section>
<%if(!currentUser){%><section class="card settings-card"><h2>Akkaunt egasini tasdiqlash</h2><p>O‘chirish uchun avval akkauntingizga kiring. Kirgach shu sahifaga qaytasiz.</p><a class="btn danger" href="/login?next=%2Faccount-deletion">Kirish va akkauntni o‘chirish</a></section><%}else{%>
<section class="card settings-card"><h2>@<%=currentUser.username%> akkauntini doimiy o‘chirish</h2><%if(error){%><div class="alert"><%=error%></div><%}%><form method="post" action="/account-deletion" class="password-form"><label>Parolingiz<input type="password" name="password" required autocomplete="current-password"></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="confirm" value="1" required><span>Bu amal qaytarilmasligini va akkauntim bilan bog‘liq ma’lumotlar o‘chirilishini tushunaman.</span></label><button class="btn danger full">Akkaunt va ma’lumotlarni o‘chirish</button></form></section><%}%>
</main><%- include('../partials/footer') %>
